al tweaks Gave Advent a little more HP","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:15:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693639","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4325460-1842212951308057","game_id":"steam-4325460","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Sinden, Gamefeel, Story","summary":"Hello everywormy 🪱Been a while! Most of the changes this update revolve around Sinden/Lightgun usage and the design tweaks required to be able to accommodate it. Although I wanted to get this update out much earlier, making the game lightgun friendly ended up being a much bigger undertaking than I thought it'd be: using a different peripheral + turning the mouse cursor off necessitated a lot of design (and code) changes for how shooting works.For example (and I know this is pulling back the curt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T17:29:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308057","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4325460-1827626365756481","game_id":"steam-4325460","kind":"update","title":"Website + Demo Gamefeel Update","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played the demo so far!!Between reddit/youtube comments and the steam board, I got a lot of fine polish feedback about the demo, and since most of it pertained to game feel and balance I was able to squint my brain into doing it as one pass, wooooo~Also, I finally got a website up and running. On the page is some information about the game, plus some character bios of most of the main characters, including ones that aren't in the demo yet. Eventually I'll put up a media an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T04:07:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365756481","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4325460-1825093633190291","game_id":"steam-4325460","kind":"announcement","title":"Options Menu Fix","summary":"Hey all,The default menu params for the tnf demo weren't setting properly in the demo, which was breaking the tutorial. This should now be fixed.Thanks for being patient!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-21T16:24:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633190291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4325460-1825093633189603","game_id":"steam-4325460","kind":"update","title":"Options Menu Update","summary":"Thank you to everyone that's played the demo so far!After getting some feedback across the steam and itchio versions of the demo, I went ahead and updated it to include an options menu. As of right now, the options will only be accessible in the main menu, but eventually I'll hook it up to the pause screen as well. (Seeing that the demo is less than 10 minutes long I figured I could treat myself to lowering it down on the priority list.)In addition, the options menu now comes with two oft reques","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-21T07:51:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633189603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4325460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4325